    LLM: "Hold cards that can form straights or high pairs; discard weak high cards that block sequences.\n\nTrack which ranks have been dealt to estimate opponents' straight potential; prefer connected cards over disconnected high cards.\n\nBalance bluffing a strong sequence with actually building one; late position can represent straights more effectively.",
